Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: aw88261: fix register access and power sequencing

Correct PID 2113 feedback/boost/trim fields and propagate profile, volume,
fade and startup I/O failures. Match the OEM dither startup sequence, cancel
pending startup before shutdown and keep the event-only DAPM widget NOPM.
Shutdown attempts all mute, feedback-disable and power-down operations.

The register layout and startup order were checked against the pinned OnePlus
AW882xx driver and validated with all six Caihong Music profiles.

--- a/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c
@@ -25,121 +25,121 @@
 	.val_format_endian = REGMAP_ENDIAN_BIG,
 };
 
